From 8dd58ed550d0efa1952ea28e08fdb81c345f73b0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bb-machine <ubuntu@bb-machine>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 19:50:34 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] fix(codex): share the resume construction deadline

Carry the remaining thread construction deadline into the Codex child
resume request, reserving time for cleanup. Upstream no longer issues
post-initialize usage reads, so resume never waits on optional usage;
the stalled rate-limit regression keeps that true.
